An observation-family goal is immutable and is identified by category, exact
carrier IS_TYPE Claim, exact left and right HAS_TYPE Claims, and Context bridge.
A goal stores no selected rule, search state, source position, conversion cache,
or object witness.

Action requests are immutable and graph-consed by their complete typed keys.
Action results are separate records keyed by request ID. A request is never
solved by mutating its identity. Context, Substitution, Operation, Claim,
Derivation, action, certificate, and compiler-work IDs never occur in object
Term identity.

For Gamma |- A type, Type action first constructs
Gamma^R.x0:A[pi0].x1:A[pi1]. Its relation type is formed in that endpoint
Context. A Type result contains the endpoint Context, both endpoint bindings,
the relation type Term, its exact IS_TYPE Claim, and Context certificates.

The first-fragment object forms are OBSERVATION_TYPE(A0,A1,a0,a1) and
OBSERVATION_WITNESS(a0,a1). All operands are ordinary Term IDs. Homogeneous Eq
is OBSERVATION_TYPE(A,A,a,b). The ap operation is a typed compiler action that
generates exact HAS_TYPE Derivations. A diagonal action may generate an
OBSERVATION_WITNESS Term. The action of a Context variable is the corresponding
relation binding already present in the Context bridge. A witness Term stores
no action ID and is not evidence without its Derivation.
Reflexivity is the diagonal instance of ap, not a separate primitive REFL node.

Type-action dispatch is selected by one declarative type-former descriptor.
Ordinary ADTs, pure Pi, pure Comp, pure Thunk, and OBSERVATION_HIGHER are
admitted. Universe and host primitive actions are explicitly unsupported;
effectful and unresolved computation rows are residual.

Observation planning is repeatable: an already interned candidate remains a
valid candidate even when a later planning run allocates no new record. The
plan-and-execute boundary starts exact Type actions and starts Term actions only
for exact diagonal candidates; forming an uninhabited distinct-constructor
family never fabricates an inhabitant.

For a same-constructor ordinary ADT action, the object witness remains
OBSERVATION_WITNESS(left,right). Its exact Derivation is
OBSERVATION_CONSTRUCTOR_WITNESS and contains one accepted field-witness Claim
per constructor argument in telescope order. Field evidence is proof authority,
not part of TermDB object identity. Recursive constructor action recursively
uses the same immutable Type and Term action requests.

For Comp(empty,A), RETURN action recursively acts on its value and records the
resulting witness Claim as an OBSERVATION_RETURN_WITNESS premise. THUNK action
does the same for its enclosed pure computation using
OBSERVATION_THUNK_WITNESS. Neither rule admits an effectful or unresolved row.

APP action recursively acts on its function and argument premises. Its exact
OBSERVATION_APP_WITNESS derivation stores both child witness Claims. A child
witness may be any inhabitant of the generated observation type, including a
Context relation variable; it need not have OBSERVATION_WITNESS object syntax.

LAMBDA action constructs or reuses the bridge for its binder Context. The body
witness lives under the ordered x0, x1, and input-relation extensions. Replay
requires that this Context extends the outer bridge Context by exactly those
three fields and that abstracting the body endpoints reconstructs both outer
Lambda endpoints up to shared Core alpha shape.

MATCH action recursively acts on its scrutinee and every branch body in the
relational bridge of that branch Context and records all child witnesses. A
Match whose branches share one graph body independent of all pattern binders is
a constant eliminator and reduces to that body under the ordinary Match
reduction profile, including for a neutral scrutinee.

An OBSERVATION_MATCH_WITNESS derivation records the accepted source Match Claim
in addition to both endpoint Match Claims, the scrutinee witness, and every
branch witness. Branch witnesses act on the source branch body under the
left/right branch Context extensions. The enclosing Match derivation closes the
source IH frame against the independently reindexed endpoint Match frames; an
IH frame ID is never treated as an ordinary binder ID or silently renamed by a
branch-local substitution.

INDUCTION_HYPOTHESIS action is guarded by an accepted source
INDUCTION_HYPOTHESIS_ELIM Claim and the observation witness of its recursive
argument. It does not recursively invoke the enclosing Match action and cannot
introduce a cycle in the Derivation DAG.

A substitution action owns a typed naturality certificate for both endpoint
squares under an exact pure conversion profile and deterministic step budget.
Exhaustion is residual and never equality. Definitional conversion remains
meta-level evidence and successful object proofs never extend global DefEq.

Family formation and family inhabitation are distinct. OBS_ADT_DISTINCT forms
an uninhabited observation family; it is not compiler contradiction. Work
items and residual obligations are compiler-local and are not artifact roots
in fragment version 2.
